<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-C-C Amatil appoints financial officer.</title>
<headline>RTRS-C-C Amatil appoints financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coca-Cola Amatil Ltd said on Friday it had appointed Mike Ihlein, managing director of its Poland operations, as chief financial officer with responsibility for the company's global financial activities.  </p>
<p>C-C Amatil announced also that John Priest, who was chief financial officer, had been appointed executive director, corporate development.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
